# Close the import loop

When a fix exists because extract JSON, BYO text, detect rules, or enrichment missed a mechanic:

- Update Drive import JSON if a fixture exists (`docs/homebrew-import-review.md`, `HOMEBREW_IMPORT_JSON_DIR`). Do not copy copyrighted source text into the repo.
- Update BYO / AI hints in `modifier-wiring-registry.ts`. Touch `byo-import-kit.ts`, `parse-ai-mechanics.ts`, and `detect-feature-modifier-rules.ts` when the kind or phrase is new.
- Update the class enrichment preset when that pack attaches the mechanic.
- Add or extend `byo-prompt-guidance` and/or the class Drive import test.

If the same mistake appears in more than one extract, fix the sanitizer or prompt, not only one JSON row.
